error[E0534]: field 'x' of a fields-only anonymous class needs a type
 --> $DIR/anonymous-untyped-field.nra:2:30
  |
2 | let point: class (export let x = 0;) = new;
  |                              ^ 'x' has no type annotation
  |
  = note: the types of its fields are what identify a fields-only anonymous class
  = help: write the type after the name, as in 'x: int'

For more information about this error, try `neura explain E0534`.
